@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@customerId = 1

### Place order (cart and default address must exist; see cart.http and customer.http)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/orders
X-Customer-Id: {{customerId}}
Idempotency-Key: demo-order-1

### Same key again: 200 with the same order
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/orders
X-Customer-Id: {{customerId}}
Idempotency-Key: demo-order-1

### My orders
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/orders
X-Customer-Id: {{customerId}}

### Cancel (replace 1 with the order id)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/orders/1/cancellation
X-Customer-Id: {{customerId}}